tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/e5ac6353b6eb817e68c9eb3477fc6fef59737eca/ss_e5ac6353b6eb817e68c9eb3477fc6fef59737eca.600x338.jpg?t=1760562403"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/c4354140582d9dd5e179dd9009bcd9c1d7f440fb/ss_c4354140582d9dd5e179dd9009bcd9c1d7f440fb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760562403","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810660/c4354140582d9dd5e179dd9009bcd9c1d7f440fb/ss_c4354140582d9dd5e179dd9009bcd9c1d7f440fb.600x338.jpg?t=1760562403"}],"short_description":"Astro Burn is a sci-fi, retro-inspired bullet hell shoot \u2019em up. Play as a feline space pilot and her robot buddy, blasting, dodging, and upgrading through waves of evil robot machines. Uncover Earth\u2019s mysterious downfall in a fast-paced, pixel-art arcade adventure packed with chaos and style.","steam_appid":3810660,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://www.beyond-the-pixels.com/contact-8"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.beyond-the-pixels.com"}